  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Coal?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a7/Coal.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711233731\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coal\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 33</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 10</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  Instant</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Mine</span><span title=\"Mine\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/mine-7452\" title=\"Mine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mine\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Coal</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 33.\n</p><p>Like all products, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Extracting coal</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a0/Mine.png/revision/latest?cb=20150714140453\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Mine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mine\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Mine</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Coal is found in the <a href=\"/wiki/mine-7452\" title=\"Mine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mine</a>.\n</p><p>To extract coal, players need one of the following supplies. Each type of supplies gives different numbers of ore, as shown below.\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/dynamite-3037\" title=\"Dynamite\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Dynamite\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/tnt-barrel-3038\" title=\"TNT barrel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TNT barrel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/shovel-3036\" title=\"Shovel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shovel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/pickaxe-14244\" title=\"Pickaxe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pickaxe\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x4</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x5</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes no time to extract coal but the process is randomized: players might get any of the available Mine products when using mine supplies, as well as an extra <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamond</a>. It is observed that the chance to obtain coal, <a href=\"/wiki/gold-ore-2561\" title=\"Gold Ore\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">gold ore</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/iron-ore-13486\" title=\"Iron Ore\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iron ore</a> is quite similar. Each extracted coal gives players 3 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling coal</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside Shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Coal can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 108 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 units.</li>\n<li>Buying a supply tool costs between 25 and 126 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using coal</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Coal is used to make the following <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a>:</li></ul>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/refined-coal-13488\" title=\"Refined coal\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Refined coal\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/refined-coal-13488\" title=\"Refined Coal\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Refined Coal</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a7/Coal.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711233731\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coal\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 33\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Coal is commonly found on <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a>.\n<ul><li>This is probably due to its limited uses, unlike gold ore which can make <a href=\"/wiki/gracious-bouquet-32998\" title=\"Gracious Bouquet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gracious Bouquet</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/fancy-cake-32990\" title=\"Fancy Cake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fancy Cake</a>, and iron ore which can make <a href=\"/wiki/bright-bouquet-28464\" title=\"Bright Bouquet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bright Bouquet</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Selling coal is not profitable at all. You should always transform it into refined coal. Selling it is already profitable at this stage, but to have more benefits, you can make <a href=\"/wiki/iron-bracelet-13118\" title=\"Iron Bracelet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Iron Bracelet</a> or upgrade personal train in <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Town</a> to gain <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a> easily as visitors who are brought by personal train only visit one town building only.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Truck</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Town</a> orders never require coal.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-mine-products-7567\" title=\"Category:Mine Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mine Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/coal-13487\" title=\"Coal\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coal\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/gold-ore-2561\" title=\"Gold Ore\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gold Ore\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/iron-ore-13486\" title=\"Iron Ore\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Iron Ore\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/platinum-ore-2564\" title=\"Platinum Ore\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Platinum Ore\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"58\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/silver-ore-2556\" title=\"Silver Ore\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Silver Ore\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260828130410\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.090 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.147 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 763/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5961/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 530/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 969837/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  104.722      1 -total\n 74.00%   77.495      1 Template:Infobox\n 18.47%   19.344      8 Template:Infoicon\n 14.60%   15.294      1 Template:Navigation\n  8.00%    8.375      1 Template:MineProductsMenu\n  4.48%    4.689      1 Template:Item_Usage\n  1.78%    1.868      4 Template:Clr\n  1.65%    1.732      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  1.63%    1.705      1 Template:Languages\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:13487-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260828130410 and revision id 107460. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\